OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the morning with some
OL,6,Frain or drizzle. Some showers breaking
OL,7,Fout in the afternoon, occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy and perhaps thundery, but also
OL,9,Fsome bright spells breaking through at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers at first, heavy and thundery
OL,14,Fat times. These soon fading through
OL,15,Fthe evening. Becoming cloudy and
OL,16,Fbreezy overnight with patchy light
OL,17,Frain or showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
