OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FIt will be breezy and
OL,6,Fcloudy with showers or longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain, heavy at times, particularly
OL,8,Fin the north and west.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FMostly dry with bright spells and just
OL,12,Fa few showers on Thursday. A mix of
OL,13,Fdry interludes and showers or longer
OL,14,Fspells of rain on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
